    "name": "PhiloDeka",
    "steam_appid": 3248110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/d2d6eb130ed090956d6e9ea57442c5c9.avif?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an elegant, minimalist aesthetic where numbers and strategy intertwine. <strong>PhiloDeka</strong> is a unique card-based roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Runes, collect the Charmstones, and use your &quot;Shaping&quot; skills to craft the &quot;Deka&quot; (multiples of 10). You can freely reshape your hand and enjoy the pure satisfaction of planning and harvesting through wondrous chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/4a777bf8032b458ae0faaeadcc62f96d.poster.avif?t=1754981409\" width=1440 height=810 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/4a777bf8032b458ae0faaeadcc62f96d.webm?t=1754981409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/4a777bf8032b458ae0faaeadcc62f96d.mp4?t=1754981409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Your Path to Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Runes + 7 Shaping Skills + (100+ Charmstones) = Countless Strategic Combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Runes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 distinct Runes offer unique buffs and build directions, growing stronger as you level them up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Tree] Rune: Start with an extra Shaping skill and gain extra Acorns each level for upgrades and shop purchases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Wind] Rune: Make quick decisions within a time limit to earn astonishing rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...more Runes wait for you to master.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shaping Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexibly alter the numbers on your cards to trigger Charmstone rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charmstones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost points, draw cards, restore skills, freeze, accumulate, release... A wide variety of Charmstones interact deeply with Runes and Shaping Skills, creating powerful chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deftly combine these three elements to explore and polish your ultimate strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Adventure Full of Surprises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Exploration: Randomly generated hands and shops ensure every journey is filled with the unknown and new surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Strategy: In [Challenge Mode], you will also encounter special challenges named [Perplexity] and [Chaos]. They will subvert the rules and test the adaptability and strength of your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a World of Zen</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist Aesthetics: A simple and soft visual design creates a tranquil atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing Soundtrack: A background score that accompanies your thought process, helping you sink into the realm of PhiloDeka.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/0be4341a2c739cd134d0656aa7da7194.avif?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>PhiloDeka</strong>, sculpt your unique build through random adventures, and find your own harmony and perfection in a digital zen garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/371712f2dd71ac561b3ab6312a191072.avif?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/d2d6eb130ed090956d6e9ea57442c5c9.avif?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an elegant, minimalist aesthetic where numbers and strategy intertwine. <strong>PhiloDeka</strong> is a unique card-based roguelike game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Runes, collect the Charmstones, and use your &quot;Shaping&quot; skills to craft the &quot;Deka&quot; (multiples of 10). You can freely reshape your hand and enjoy the pure satisfaction of planning and harvesting through wondrous chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/4a777bf8032b458ae0faaeadcc62f96d.poster.avif?t=1754981409\" width=1440 height=810 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/4a777bf8032b458ae0faaeadcc62f96d.webm?t=1754981409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/4a777bf8032b458ae0faaeadcc62f96d.mp4?t=1754981409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft Your Path to Victory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Runes + 7 Shaping Skills + (100+ Charmstones) = Countless Strategic Combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Runes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 distinct Runes offer unique buffs and build directions, growing stronger as you level them up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Tree] Rune: Start with an extra Shaping skill and gain extra Acorns each level for upgrades and shop purchases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Wind] Rune: Make quick decisions within a time limit to earn astonishing rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...more Runes wait for you to master.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shaping Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexibly alter the numbers on your cards to trigger Charmstone rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Charmstones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost points, draw cards, restore skills, freeze, accumulate, release... A wide variety of Charmstones interact deeply with Runes and Shaping Skills, creating powerful chain reactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deftly combine these three elements to explore and polish your ultimate strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Adventure Full of Surprises</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Exploration: Randomly generated hands and shops ensure every journey is filled with the unknown and new surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving Strategy: In [Challenge Mode], you will also encounter special challenges named [Perplexity] and [Chaos]. They will subvert the rules and test the adaptability and strength of your build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/1f2984b0e61dd5d9d8e8bb9aca618ef7.webp?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immerse Yourself in a World of Zen</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist Aesthetics: A simple and soft visual design creates a tranquil atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soothing Soundtrack: A background score that accompanies your thought process, helping you sink into the realm of PhiloDeka.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/0be4341a2c739cd134d0656aa7da7194.avif?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join <strong>PhiloDeka</strong>, sculpt your unique build through random adventures, and find your own harmony and perfection in a digital zen garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3248110/extras/371712f2dd71ac561b3ab6312a191072.avif?t=1754981409\" data-has-big width=800 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Every multiple of 10 is a harvest by design. Wield your &quot;Shaping&quot; skills to bend the numbers, craft the &quot;Deka&quot;, and unleash surprising chain reactions. Create your own little world of &quot;Number \u00d7 Strategy \u00d7 Zen&quot;.",
